<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A0.SS2.SSS3" title="In -B Benchmark Details ‣ Do What You Say: Steering Vision-Language-Action Models via Runtime Reasoning-Action Alignment Verification" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">-B</span>3 </span>Behavior Composition Tasks</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
