<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A0.T7.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">TABLE VII</span>: </span><span id="A0.T7.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Compositional Generalization Performance<span id="A0.T7.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">. Success rates (%) are averaged over 50 trials. As the training dataset size and diversity increase from LIBERO-10 to LIBERO-100, our method’s performance advantage over baselines becomes more pronounced. Entries marked with ‘—‘ are not applicable for that training dataset. For each training dataset and each task, the highest success rate is marked as bold.</span></span></figcaption>
